WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.650
You know him?

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:14.230
I remember him well.

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:16.110
Then, will you tell me?

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:18.400
Where is he now?!

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.900
Once I know that, I can...

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:26.940
There's no need.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:33.360
I already took care of that guy
with my own hands six years ago.

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:45.690
Hey, Five's doppelgänger.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:49.780
You're a Gun Slave Unit, right?

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:53.650
My name is Juzo Inui.

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:54.980
Why?

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:57.730
Why did you eliminate my partner?

00:00:57.730 --> 00:01:00.440
Wasn't he one of yours?

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:36.510
Scar

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:34.320
Boy!

00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:47.320
So, that intense guy was
one of Juzo's acquaintances.

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:48.150
Yeah.

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:53.150
Then, he told me to head on home since
they had some things to talk about.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:55.440
Boy, that throat of yours.

00:02:55.440 --> 00:03:00.530
You got that done while you were
caught by Spitzbergen, right?

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:03.690
Huh? Y-Yeah...

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:08.360
That's the work of my brother, Victor.

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:11.030
R-Really?!

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:16.110
I couldn't work on your vocal cords
easily because of Harmony.

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:20.570
There aren't many people who
can do a procedure like that.

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:22.030
I see...

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:27.280
Mary, were you able to meet your brother?

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:31.190
It seems like the circumstances
were troubling,

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:33.690
but were you able to accomplish your goal?

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:36.320
For now, I guess.

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:39.570
It seems his real body is somewhere else.

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:43.900
But I was able to talk with him.

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:46.570
I got to ask him things that
had always been on my mind.

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:50.820
To be honest, I still haven't
been able to take it all in.

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:53.820
But I know what I need to do now.

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:58.860
Now I just need to find his body
and shoot my boob rockets at him.

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:01.400
Boob... rockets?

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:05.280
Well, I feel a lot better now.

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:13.030
Your brother is still trying to atone
so many years after the war.

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:18.730
Well, those are the actions of his puppet,
so I'm not really sure.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:25.530
But if I saw that my work was hurting and
killing so many people with my own eyes...

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:28.940
...I think I would have regretted
what I had done myself.

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:34.530
I wonder how Juzo feels...

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:39.070
Oh, let me make this clear.

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:42.400
I'm not blaming you or anything.

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:47.440
The fact that you did Five
in is just crazy surprising.

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:52.570
I'm the one who abandoned
my partner, Five.

00:04:52.570 --> 00:04:54.730
You're a Hands.

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:55.730
Yeah.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:05:01.150
I was the Hands of
Gun Slave Unit Device 5.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.070
Until that day...

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:09.940
Six years ago, when the soldiers started
saying the war was over soon...

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:15.730
It was the last day I ate my favorite
crawfish boil as a normal man.

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:20.730
The higher ups ordered me
to hand over my partner.

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:24.980
They said that since the war was over,

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:29.360
they'd turn the Gun Slave
Units back to normal.

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:32.860
That was all a farce, of course.

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:36.820
They were planning on disposing
the Gun Slave Units.

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:41.280
I followed my orders,
even though I knew the truth.

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:45.070
I mean, soldiers are supposed to follow
the orders of their superiors, after all.

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:50.280
But not him.

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:57.570
I'm no longer a tool since my
Hands tossed me aside, right?

00:05:57.570 --> 00:06:01.690
So that means I'm finally free...

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:08.860
That's the reason Five held
such a crazy grudge against me.

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:13.110
I never regretted my decision, though.

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:17.980
I had to go back home to Emma.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:21.570
What happened to Five
after that is all under wraps.

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:24.440
So, can you tell me what happened?

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:28.730
Why did Five end up
getting snuffed out by you?

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:35.440
Five escaped from the military.

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:38.860
That totally sounds like something he'd do.

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:44.320
He started a rebellion with other
Gun Slave Units and their Hands.

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:49.730
A rebellion?! And so, you...

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:54.900
That guy will never show up at your doorstep.

00:06:57.070 --> 00:07:00.860
Does Juzo regret it?

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:03.610
The things he did during the war.

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:05.780
He probably does.

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:07.610
Really?!

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:12.320
I mean, he's always worried
about having no money.

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:15.070
That's not what I'm talking about...

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:20.820
I mean, Gun Slave Units made huge
contributions to the great war, right?

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:24.320
He's not the type to act
like an Armed or anything,

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:29.690
but he probably would have gotten a
better job if he had done things differently.

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:33.190
Then I could have been hired
as his personal engineer

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:38.070
and spent my days messing with all the
extensions I wanted without any worries.

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:39.730
Man, such a waste!

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:44.440
I thought a resolver was an
admirable job that helped people--

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:47.610
I see. That's why Juzo...

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:53.780
Mary, you know that there were other
Gun Slave Units beside Juzo, right?

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:59.440
Well, normal people don't know,
but any proper engineer would...

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:05.940
Near the end of the war, 13 Gun Slave Units
were active, including Juzo.

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:11.400
They were two-person teams with their Hands.

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:14.110
There was a total of 13 pairs.

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:20.440
The entire unit was called the Noble Rot.

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:26.940
In the past, there was a unit
called the Noble Rot.

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:32.940
Soldiers who dropped to rock bottom
for the sake of their country.

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:37.360
They seemed noble for giving
themselves to the rot.

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:42.610
Weaponized Extendeds that
changed the flow of the war

00:08:42.610 --> 00:08:45.570
with their immense power and range.

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:53.070
But now, there are only four confirmed
Gun Slave Units in existence.

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:56.030
Two are imprisoned in Wunder Bender,

00:08:56.030 --> 00:09:00.530
one under the supervision of Berühren, and Juzo.

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:02.360
Four.

00:09:02.360 --> 00:09:05.320
Then, did the other nine die in the war?

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:06.480
No.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:13.480
None of them perished during the war.
They all died afterwards.

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:16.150
How could that...?

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:19.280
The military tried to dispose of them in secret.

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:25.440
Why? The country was able to win the
war thanks to the Gun Slave Units!

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:27.190
Once the war was over,

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:32.690
powerful weapons like them would
be a source of public backlash.

00:09:32.690 --> 00:09:36.110
Then, how did Juzo make it through safely?

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:42.530
Looks like I owe you a huge one.

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:44.650
Don't worry about it.

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:48.360
Hey.

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:52.610
I remembered that partner of yours.

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:56.820
He was a weirdo that gave
his Gun Slave Unit a name.

00:09:57.900 --> 00:10:00.480
I totally understand now.

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:06.360
That guy really saw you as his partner.

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:08.480
See ya, Juzo.

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:18.780
It seems tacky to call you by your
number like other Gun Slave Units.

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:23.780
Well, what about using the language
of my grandpa's native country?

00:10:23.780 --> 00:10:29.610
Thirteen... So that would
translate to Juzo. How about it?

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:35.030
You just followed your
orders from the higher-ups.

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:37.780
It's not your fault.

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:40.320
I was the one in the wrong.

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:04.690
Didn't realize you were there.

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:08.730
What's wrong?

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:11.440
Verrat Dreizhen.

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:14.070
The brethren slayer, Device 13!

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:22.980
You were ordered to eliminate nine
Gun Slave Units that deserted the military.

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:25.780
Where did you hear that from?

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:28.280
You regret it, Juzo.

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:34.400
The fact that you abandoned your
comrades and murdered them.

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:40.110
That's why you never use
your own power for yourself.

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:46.610
As a way to atone for your sins,
you became a resolver to help others.

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:53.190
Who was it that put such
ridiculous notions into your head?

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:58.690
I just finally realized it.

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:04.780
I've been leaning on you
since the day I met you.

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:08.860
Juzo, you always fight for someone else.

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:13.280
All for the sake of other selfish people!

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:15.230
Just like the job today!

00:12:15.230 --> 00:12:19.900
Even though she did it for the one she loves...

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:22.730
You always sacrifice yourself
for the wishes of others!

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:24.940
Then, what about you?

00:12:26.610 --> 00:12:35.150
I... Before I lost my memory,
it seems I was funding Spitzbergen.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:36.650
What?

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:40.440
I was aiding terrorists!

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:48.230
I might have been the reason that Colt
and so many other people suffered!

00:12:48.230 --> 00:12:54.280
Even so, I want to save the people
who are being sacrificed for Berühren!

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:57.900
But, I don't know anymore.

00:12:57.900 --> 00:13:02.110
I don't even know if those
are my true feelings anymore...

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:05.320
What can I do to make it up to everyone?!

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:08.030
I can't do anything...

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:10.690
I'm not like you, Juzo.

00:13:10.690 --> 00:13:15.280
I wish I never found out about my own past...

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:22.360
Would not knowing have changed
what you've already done?

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:25.730
You can't decide on things you don't know.

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:27.190
That's...

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:33.110
What's important is what you'll
choose once you find out.

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:36.900
You obtained a chance to make a choice.

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:42.070
You get to decide your own worth.

00:13:50.730 --> 00:13:56.150
I look forward to your results,
Cunningham Chief of Security.

00:13:56.150 --> 00:13:59.860
Yes! Even if it means my life!

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:02.730
I will remember those words.

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:08.730
If you can show us your worth,
we may still deem you useful.

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:10.690
Y-Yes!

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:16.820
What a pain.

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:19.610
Pepper, you took a while.

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:23.940
That pig, Cunningham,
just kept squealing on and on.

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:25.440
Here, Seven.

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:29.530
Yay! This many?!

00:14:29.530 --> 00:14:31.440
Don't eat them all at once.

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:32.650
Yeah!

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:37.820
We have work to do after you're done eating.

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:40.690
You look happy, Pepper.

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:47.280
It's a boring mission, but the pig
said something pretty interesting.

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:51.940
I guess we can play along a bit.

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:06.190
How strange.

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:10.730
A mere quarter of a century ago,
when I had begun my research...

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:16.320
...no one had any interest
in extension technology.

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:22.230
Even someone god-like and majestic...

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:27.730
Even a man such as this was used as a
tool to show off Berühren's influence.

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:30.150
How laughable.

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:37.570
No matter the era, the gods of the masses
always end up being something like that.

00:15:37.570 --> 00:15:41.400
By the way, do we still not
know of Victor's whereabouts?

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:42.690
Yes.

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:46.110
True, he is a dangerous man.

00:15:46.110 --> 00:15:51.070
However, as long as his goal is the
destruction of all Extendeds,

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:54.820
he will not get in our way.

00:15:54.820 --> 00:16:00.360
He was deeply involved in the
development of extension technology.

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:06.440
Saying he is the very thing Spitzbergen
wishes to destroy is not an exaggeration.

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:12.650
It was a mistake to let him
join our ranks to begin with.

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:19.070
Then, shouldn't you destroy me as well, Kunugi?

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:20.860
Please do not jest.

00:16:20.860 --> 00:16:26.360
Spitzbergen exists because of you.

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:30.070
However, your actions as of late
have gone against our creed

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:33.730
to stamp out extension technology...

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:38.900
It is true that there are members
who have begun to think in such a way.

00:16:38.900 --> 00:16:43.820
Though I did it on my own, it was
very difficult to capture that boy.

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:47.360
Yet you let him go so easily.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:55.360
We were unable to get that data and we let
such a useful pawn against Berühren go.

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:59.730
Your decisions have been difficult to accept.

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:05.150
Do you have an objective
you have yet to tell all of us?

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:15.940
I knew you would come... Master Tetsuro.

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:22.320
As promised, we will remove all the
people monitoring those close to you

00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:27.030
and ensure their future safety.

00:17:27.030 --> 00:17:29.070
Please be at ease.

00:17:29.070 --> 00:17:33.690
We will take good care of your body.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:38.570
However, before that...

00:17:42.030 --> 00:17:50.360
That reaction does indeed tell me
that Harmony is currently activated.

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:55.530
The device we installed in your
throat is not just a voice box.

00:17:55.530 --> 00:18:01.940
It is a device to lock the
current state of Harmony.

00:18:01.940 --> 00:18:09.280
Until we deactivate it,
you cannot change Harmony's target.

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:18.980
Device 13, you can hear my voice while
Master Tetsuro is controlling you, right?

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:22.030
You must be completely puzzled.

00:18:23.110 --> 00:18:28.570
Who I am, and why an old man
such as myself would do this...

00:18:28.570 --> 00:18:31.150
The night is young.

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:34.030
Let me tell you an old story.

00:18:35.150 --> 00:18:40.480
I had an older twin brother named Lawrence.

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:44.610
Unlike me, who was born with weak legs
and had a servile personality,

00:18:44.610 --> 00:18:47.730
he was a great man.

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:53.530
I admired him as a perfect
existence when I was young.

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:56.730
It was my seventeenth winter.

00:18:56.730 --> 00:19:05.690
As that war had grown larger and ever
more hopeless, my brother was drafted.

00:19:05.690 --> 00:19:11.940
Though I managed to miss the draft
due to my legs, I was so frustrated.

00:19:11.940 --> 00:19:19.730
I felt like I lacked something and was
left behind by those who had everything.

00:19:20.940 --> 00:19:28.110
However, the train transporting my
brother had accidentally derailed

00:19:28.110 --> 00:19:32.440
and he returned without both his legs.

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:33.730
Lawrence.

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:39.110
What a terrible joke this is, Andy.

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:43.690
I didn't think we'd end up so similar
just because we're twins.

00:19:43.690 --> 00:19:46.030
If only it was you.

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:49.320
If it were your legs...

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:53.440
...everyone wouldn't have had to be so sad.

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:56.110
Wh-What are you saying?!

00:19:56.110 --> 00:19:59.820
We'll have to send one of
them to an institution now.

00:19:59.820 --> 00:20:04.070
If he was hurt during the war, we would
have at least gotten some compensation...

00:20:04.070 --> 00:20:06.780
It would have been better if he had died...

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:11.110
That's when I knew.

00:20:11.110 --> 00:20:14.360
There was no need to despair.

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:19.230
It wasn't me who was lacking something,

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:23.230
but this world itself that was lacking.

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:28.070
After that, I buried myself in my research.

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:32.030
Technology to support
what we lacked in reality.

00:20:32.030 --> 00:20:37.070
Later, they called it research
in extension technology.

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:38.900
Extendeds.

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:43.360
A deformed existence that is created
by supplementing something

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:45.610
one lacks with something else.

00:20:45.610 --> 00:20:49.690
Comical, yet somewhat beautiful.

00:20:49.690 --> 00:20:55.900
You are the dear children that I have created.

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:59.690
My name is Andy Wachowski.

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:06.480
In the past, I worked with Berühren to
create the theory of extension technology.

00:21:06.480 --> 00:21:08.400
And as its creator,

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:14.480
I cannot forgive the outrageous
actions of the Berühren company.

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:20.650
I will have you help me bring
judgment to Berühren.

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:27.150
Gun Slave Units have a limiter
that they cannot release without

00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:30.650
the authorization of their Hands.

00:21:30.650 --> 00:21:39.150
Master Tetsuro, the hacking abilities of
Harmony is needed to remove that limiter

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:43.190
so Device 13 can fight evenly against Seven.

00:21:49.530 --> 00:21:56.230
Now, for my sake,
unleash the power of that man.

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:29.860
What a foolish child.

00:23:28.230 --> 00:23:30.820
Looks like you all don't get it.

00:23:29.860 --> 00:23:32.070
Why are you having so
much trouble with a child?

00:23:30.820 --> 00:23:35.440
But, there is still a way
to fight against them.

00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:35.440
Now, why don't we start negotiations,
Professor Wachowski?

00:23:35.440 --> 00:23:41.860
<i>NO GUNS LIFE</i> . Episode 20.
"I'm Dreaming."
